# ============================================================ 
# COMBINED PIPELINE (GSVA, KSEA via PDC, VIPER/ARACNe/GENIE3 + TCGA PRAD fallback)
# ============================================================
# - Load Top/Bottom 250 gene lists from Excel
# - TF enrichment (Enrichr + ChEA3)
# - Pathways (FGSEA: Hallmarks/Reactome/KEGG; PROGENy scores)
# - GSVA (needs expression matrix; falls back to TCGA PRAD if none supplied)
# - KSEA (needs phospho; auto-fetches CPTAC-PRAD phospho via PDC GraphQL if none supplied)
# - Regulators (VIPER using ARACNe or inferred GENIE3 regulon; DoRothEA fallback)
# - Signature reversal: L1000FWD (opposite) → per-drug summary
# - Drug–target mapping: Open Targets GraphQL
# - Cross-evidence ranking
# - One Excel report
# ============================================================

